["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"71. 和樓天城聊聊Robotaxi和ACRush：“L2做得越厲害，離L4越遠” contest based metric system MPX Hold hard end-to-end BEV Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-08-16-zhangxiaojun-l2做得越好离l4越远-无人驾驶的路线之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d093a1c7aa808aa9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>L2做得越好離L4越遠，無人駕駛的路線之爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小馬智行樓天城認為 L2 和 L4 目標不同：L2 用戶只要夠用、成本更低，做得越好反而離 L4 越遠；L4 要的是萬小時不出事，還得有一把評價好壞的尺子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"70. 和何小鵬聊，FSD、“在血海游泳”、亂世中的英雄與狗熊 AD BOM Robot Taxi OTA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-07-16-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-大模型对小型公司不利-越强越多数据越多费用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/514c23c30b63a46b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：大模型對小型公司不利，越強越多數據越多費用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大 AI 的網絡效應是：越強所以越多數據，越多數據所以越多費用，越多費用所以要賣越多車去支持這個體系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"69. 口述全球大模型這半年：Perplexity突然火爆和尚未爆發的AI應用生態 PMF RAG MOE Scaling Law Latency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-23-zhangxiaojun-ai应用没爆发-不是产品问题是模型问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88869a8f5db7fb1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>AI應用沒爆發，不是產品問題是模型問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPT-4 出來一年多，硅谷主流 VC 投出的 AI 應用只有 Perplexity 一家跑到 2000 多萬月活；90% 的原因是只基於 GPT-4 的能力不夠，只能做信息組合，做不了長距離推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Perplexity</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"68. 和MiniMax天使投資人聊，MiniMax幕後故事和大模型資本撲克牌 Club Deal corner cases MOE scale up L4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-10-zhangxiaojun-minimax-第一位投资人-大厂降价是看牌-创业公司只能认赔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6400a25bba631a90-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0610</span></div>\n<h2>MiniMax 第一位投資人：大廠降價是看牌，創業公司只能認賠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大廠做模型可以不賺錢、從雲計算把錢掙回來，創業公司被拖進價格戰卻無處回血；MiniMax 的解法是模型質量第一，靠海外 2C 產品收錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"67. 談談黃仁勳搭建的組織系統：分布式操作系統，“就像一臺GPU” Conway&#x27;s Law context, not control Zero Billion Dollar Market chiplet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-31-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有五年计划-黄仁勋把公司做成了一台-gpu/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0eed2af727e6cd8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0531</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達沒有五年計劃：黃仁勳把公司做成了一臺 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳的八條反常識管理法不是散點，而是一套分布式操作系統：60 個高管直接彙報、薪酬精確到一美分相同、不做一對一、不做計劃——組織溝通結構決定了產品架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"66. 和李志飛聊IPO、GPT-4o和你不知道的前沿科技創業的痛 VLA DiT In Context Learning codec P&amp;L\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-23-zhangxiaojun-前沿科技创业的痛-上市那天-我觉得对不起这12年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b6a457f38ae1bd4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>前沿科技創業的痛：上市那天，我覺得對不起這12年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出門問問創始人李志飛說，敲鐘那一刻他想的不是榮耀，而是「今天這個結果對得起我12年受的磨難嗎——對不起」。他把前沿科技創業的宿命總結成一塊隨時會化的浮冰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">前沿科技創業</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"65. 風險投資的鑰匙失靈了嗎？和夢秋聊：蟄伏、更少人的遊戲和齧齒動物 明股實債 check size power law foundation model AI for science AI for coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-22-zhangxiaojun-vc-的以小博大逻辑失效了-我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3a24508c632217d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0422</span></div>\n<h2>VC 的以小博大邏輯失效了，我們改做侏羅紀的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美元 VC 的募資端和退出端同時被掐斷，靠十個 check 裡中兩三個的槓桿故事講